# The URL structure is a redirect obligation from launch onward (AGENTS.md).
# /welcome/ was a live, indexed URL on the GitHub Pages site whose whole job was
# to point at the homepage; the Astro rebuild deleted the stub, so without this
# rule every existing link, bookmark and search result for it lands on the 404
# page. 301 rather than 302 because the move is permanent and the canonical
# signal that used to live in the stub has to be restored.
/welcome/ / 301
/welcome  / 301
